_:b217_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Durability tests in the compact sensorReport form of the common/assessment EPCIS binding. Same information as an oea:TestExecution with an oea:MeasurementResult at event level: the event is the execution (eventTime, readPoint say when and where); each sensorElement is one test." .
_:b217_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "GS1 demo prefix 952 (7-digit GCP: 9521234)." .
_:b217_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HTTP header: GS1-Extensions: oec=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/common/core/,oea=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/common/assessment/,eutex=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/eu/textile/" .
_:b217_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "See: extensions/common/assessment/docs/EPCIS_BINDING.md" .
_:b217_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Use this form when a test rig or LIMS reports raw results; use the object form (observation-durability.jsonld) when conditions, settings, criteria or derived indicators belong to the record." .
_:b217_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "sensorMetadata.dataProcessingMethod names the oea:TestMethod individual, sensorMetadata.bizRules the standard's catalogue page; each sensorReport carries one result: type is the oea:PerformanceParameter IRI, value and uom the measured quantity (UN/CEFACT Rec 20; C62 for a grade or a cycle count)." .
_:b217_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.0" .
